<title>NORWAY: Christiania, Storebrand merger timetable.</title>
<headline>Christiania, Storebrand merger timetable.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Christiania Bank og Kreditkasse ASA and Storebrand ASA released on Wednesday the following preliminary timetable for a proposed merger between the two:</p>
<p>End April - Board approvals of merger plan</p>
<p>April 29  - Christiania Bank annual general meeting</p>
<p>April 30  - Storebrand annual general meeting</p>
<p>Mid-May   - Mailing of prospectuses to shareholders</p>
<p>June	- Extraordinary general meetings to approve merger</p>
<p>		plan and Storebrand capital increase</p>
<p>		Regulatory approvals</p>
<p>End 1997  - Merger completion</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
